An <<express:analysis_product_relationships_schema.idealisation_relationship,idealisation_relationship>> is a particular <<express:product_analysis_schema.temporal_spatial_domain,temporal_spatial_domain>> that is an idealisation of a particular <<express:product_definition_schema.product_definition,product_definition>>.
*)


(*"analysis_product_relationships_schema.idealisation_relationship.description"
the text that provides further information about the <<express:analysis_product_relationships_schema.idealisation_relationship,idealisation_relationship>>.
*)


(*"analysis_product_relationships_schema.idealisation_relationship.id"
the identifier for the <<express:analysis_product_relationships_schema.idealisation_relationship,idealisation_relationship>>.
*)


(*"analysis_product_relationships_schema.idealisation_relationship.idealisation"
the <<express:product_analysis_schema.temporal_spatial_domain,temporal_spatial_domain>> that idealises the <<express:product_definition_schema.product_definition,product_definition>>.
*)


(*"analysis_product_relationships_schema.idealisation_relationship.idealised"
the <<express:product_definition_schema.product_definition,product_definition>> that is idealised.
*)


(*"analysis_product_relationships_schema.idealisation_relationship.name"
the words by which the <<express:analysis_product_relationships_schema.idealisation_relationship,idealisation_relationship>> is known.
*)


(*"analysis_product_relationships_schema.view_relationship"
A <<express:analysis_product_relationships_schema.view_relationship,view_relationship>> is a particular <<express:analysis_schema.numerical_model,numerical_model>> that is a view of a particular <<express:product_analysis_schema.temporal_spatial_domain,temporal_spatial_domain>>.
*)


(*"analysis_product_relationships_schema.view_relationship.viewed"
the <<express:product_analysis_schema.temporal_spatial_domain,temporal_spatial_domain>> that is viewed.
*)


(*"analysis_product_relationships_schema.view_relationship.description"
the text that provides further information about the <<express:analysis_product_relationships_schema.view_relationship,view_relationship>>.
*)


(*"analysis_product_relationships_schema.view_relationship.id"
the identifier for the <<express:analysis_product_relationships_schema.view_relationship,view_relationship>>.
*)


(*"analysis_product_relationships_schema.view_relationship.name"
the words by which the <<express:analysis_product_relationships_schema.view_relationship,view_relationship>> is known.
*)


(*"analysis_product_relationships_schema.view_relationship.view"
the <<express:analysis_schema.numerical_model,numerical_model>> that is a view of the <<express:product_analysis_schema.temporal_spatial_domain,temporal_spatial_domain>>.
*)


