-- APPROVAL_SCHEMA (/Users/mulgogi/src/mn/iso-10303/schemas/resources/approval_schema/approval_schema.exp)
--
(*
ISO 10303 TC184/SC4/WG12 N8369

EXPRESS Source:
ISO 10303-41 ed4 Fundamentals of product description and support - Approval schema

The following permission notice and disclaimer shall be included in all copies of this EXPRESS schema ("the Schema"),
and derivations of the Schema:

