IS
*)

(*"approval_schema.__title"
fundamentals_of_product_description_and_support
*)


(*"approval_schema"
The subject of the *approval_schema* is the description of authorization data. Approval information concerns the acceptance of product data.

[example]
====
One version of a product may be approved for manufacture whilst another may still be undergoing design.
====

*)
(*"approval_schema.__fund_cons"

Approval information can be attached to any aspect of product data.

*)
