(*"experience_schema.experience"
An **experience** is an episode of practice, undertaken by a person or organization, that contributes to the accumulation of knowledge or a skill.
*)

(*"experience_schema.experience.__example"
100 flying hours in a Tornado jet undertaken by a particular pilot in a particular year.
*)

(*"experience_schema.experience.id"
the <<express:support_resource_schema.identifier,identifier>> that distinguishes the **experience**.
