A <<express:finite_element_analysis_control_and_result_schema.surface_3d_element_nodal_specified_variable_values,surface_3d_element_nodal_specified_variable_values>> is a state of the model that specifies the value of a variable for the nodes of a surface 3D element. The variable is interpolated within the element using the appropriate shape functions specified for the variable.

