*)

(*"finite_element_analysis_control_and_result_schema.curve_3d_node_field_aggregated_variable_values"

A <<express:finite_element_analysis_control_and_result_schema.curve_3d_node_field_aggregated_variable_values,curve_3d_node_field_aggregated_variable_values>> is a state of the model that specifies the values of a variable aggregated through the cross-section of the curve at the nodes of a curve 3D element.

*)

(*"finite_element_analysis_control_and_result_schema.curve_3d_node_field_aggregated_variable_values.simple_value"

the value of the field variable.

*)

(*"finite_element_analysis_control_and_result_schema.curve_3d_node_field_aggregated_variable_values.variable"

the type of field variable being specified.

*)

(*"finite_element_analysis_control_and_result_schema.curve_3d_node_field_aggregated_variable_values.coordinate_system"

the coordinate system for the value.

*)

(*"finite_element_analysis_control_and_result_schema.curve_3d_node_field_aggregated_variable_values.wr:WR1"

the coordinate system shall be specified if any of the specified values are not scalar.

*)

(*"finite_element_analysis_control_and_result_schema.curve_3d_node_field_aggregated_variable_values.wr:WR2"

each variable shall have a corresponding value of the proper type.

*)

(*"finite_element_analysis_control_and_result_schema.curve_3d_node_field_aggregated_variable_values.wr:WR3"

the simple value shall be unspecified when the *state_definition.defined_state* is an <<express:finite_element_analysis_control_and_result_schema.output_request_state,output_request_state>>.

*)

(*"finite_element_analysis_control_and_result_schema.curve_2d_node_field_variable_definition"

A <<express:finite_element_analysis_control_and_result_schema.curve_2d_node_field_variable_definition,curve_2d_node_field_variable_definition>> is a state of the model that specifies the values of a variable at the nodes of a curve 2D element.

*)

(*"finite_element_analysis_control_and_result_schema.curve_2d_node_field_section_variable_values"

A <<express:finite_element_analysis_control_and_result_schema.curve_2d_node_field_section_variable_values,curve_2d_node_field_section_variable_values>> is a state of the model that specifies the values of a variable across the section at the nodes of a curve 2D element.

*)

(*"finite_element_analysis_control_and_result_schema.curve_2d_node_field_section_variable_values.simple_value"

the value of the field variable.

*)

(*"finite_element_analysis_control_and_result_schema.curve_2d_node_field_section_variable_values.variable"

the type of field variable being specified.

*)

(*"finite_element_analysis_control_and_result_schema.curve_2d_node_field_section_variable_values.location"

the location at which the value of the field variable is specified.

*)

(*"finite_element_analysis_control_and_result_schema.curve_2d_node_field_section_variable_values.coordinate_system"

the coordinate system for the value.

*)

(*"finite_element_analysis_control_and_result_schema.curve_2d_node_field_section_variable_values.wr:WR1"

