A <<express:finite_element_analysis_control_and_result_schema.curve_2d_node_field_aggregated_variable_values,curve_2d_node_field_aggregated_variable_values>> is a state of the model that specifies the values of a variable aggregated through the cross-section at the nodes of a curve 2D element.

*)

(*"finite_element_analysis_control_and_result_schema.curve_2d_node_field_aggregated_variable_values.simple_value"

the value of the field variable.

*)

(*"finite_element_analysis_control_and_result_schema.curve_2d_node_field_aggregated_variable_values.variable"

the type of field variable being specified.

*)

