An <<express:finite_element_analysis_control_and_result_schema.surface_2d_substructure_element_reference,surface_2d_substructure_element_reference>> is the reference of a surface 2D element within the context of a substructure for output request or specification.

*)

(*"finite_element_analysis_control_and_result_schema.surface_2d_substructure_element_reference.substructure_element_ref"

the substructure element that the surface 2D element information references.

*)

(*"finite_element_analysis_control_and_result_schema.surface_2d_substructure_element_reference.element_ref"

the surface 2D element for output request or specification.

*)

(*"finite_element_analysis_control_and_result_schema.curve_3d_substructure_element_reference"

An <<express:finite_element_analysis_control_and_result_schema.curve_3d_substructure_element_reference,curve_3d_substructure_element_reference>> is the reference of a curve 3D element within the context of a substructure for output request or specification.

*)

(*"finite_element_analysis_control_and_result_schema.curve_3d_substructure_element_reference.substructure_element_ref"

the substructure element that the curve 3D element information references.

*)

(*"finite_element_analysis_control_and_result_schema.curve_3d_substructure_element_reference.element_ref"

the curve 3D element for output request or specification.

*)

