*)


(*"geometric_model_schema.triangulated_surface_set.triangles.__note"
In the simplest case where no point is associated with more than 1 normal and the size of <<express:geometric_model_schema.tessellated_surface_set.coordinates,coordinates>> is <<express:geometric_model_schema.tessellated_surface_set.pnmax,pnmax>> the triangles refer directly to the <<express:geometric_model_schema.tessellated_surface_set.coordinates,coordinates>> list and *pnindex* is empty. In all other cases *pnindex* is required to identify points and normals for the triangles.
*)

(*"geometric_model_schema.triangulated_surface_set.wr:WR1"
The size of **pnindex**, if non-zero, shall be equal to <<express:geometric_model_schema.tessellated_surface_set.pnmax,pnmax>>.
*)


(*"geometric_model_schema.triangulated_surface_set.wr:WR2"
**pnindex** shall not be empty unless <<express:geometric_model_schema.tessellated_surface_set.pnmax,pnmax>> is equal to the size of the <<express:geometric_model_schema.tessellated_surface_set.coordinates,coordinates>> list.
*)


(*"geometric_model_schema.triangulated_surface_set.wr:WR2.__note"
This option can only be used in the simple case of a local <<express:geometric_model_schema.tessellated_surface_set.coordinates,coordinates>> and 0 or 1 normals per point.
