*)


(*"geometric_model_schema.complex_triangulated_surface_set.triangle_fans.__note"
In the simplest case where no point is associated with more than 1 normal and the size of <<express:geometric_model_schema.tessellated_surface_set.coordinates,coordinates>> is <<express:geometric_model_schema.tessellated_surface_set.pnmax,pnmax>> the triangles defined by the strips and fans refer directly to the <<express:geometric_model_schema.tessellated_surface_set.coordinates,coordinates>> list and *pnindex* is empty. In all other cases *pnindex* is required to identify points and normals for the triangles.
*)

(*"geometric_model_schema.complex_triangulated_surface_set.wr:WR1"
The size of **pnindex**, if non-zero, shall be equal to <<express:geometric_model_schema.tessellated_surface_set.pnmax,pnmax>>.
