(*"geometric_model_schema.tessellated_curve_set"
A **tessellated_curve_set** is a type of <<express:geometric_model_schema.tessellated_item,tessellated_item>> that is a tessellated representation of a collection of curves. The geometry of each curve is defined as a list of points obtained via the **line_strips** attribute.
