IS
*)

(*"qualifications_schema.__title"
fundamentals_of_product_description_and_support
*)


(*"qualifications_schema"
The subject of the *qualifications_schema* is the identification of types of qualifications and the relationships between them. This schema provides for the definition of generic data relating to types of qualifications.

[example]
====
The identification of types of qualifications and the definition of various kinds of relationship between types of qualifications are examples of generic data relating to types of qualification.
====

*)
(*"qualifications_schema.__fund_cons"

This schema provides resources for the identification, naming, and description of:

* qualifications;
* types of qualification;
* relationships between types of qualification.

*)
(*"qualifications_schema.__expressg"
