-- SCAN_DATA_3D_SHAPE_MODEL_SCHEMA (/Users/mulgogi/src/mn/iso-10303/schemas/resources/scan_data_3d_shape_model_schema/scan_data_3d_shape_model_schema.exp)
--
(*
ISO 10303 TC184/SC4/WG12 N10694

EXPRESS Source:
ISO 10303-42 ed7 Geometric and topological representation - Scan data 3d shape model schema

The following permission notice and disclaimer shall be included in all copies of this EXPRESS schema ("the Schema"),
