*)

(*"shape_tolerance_schema.geometric_tolerance_modifier.valley_depth"
indicates that the toleranced feature specification element is the valley depth in accordance with ISO 1101 unless otherwise specified.
*)


(*"shape_tolerance_schema.geometric_tolerance_modifier.valley_depth.__note"
The symbol for valley depth is V.
*)

(*"shape_tolerance_schema.geometric_tolerance_modifier.variable_angle"
indicates that the parameter specification elements are the angular tolerance zones defined in ISO 1101 unless otherwise specified.
*)


(*"shape_tolerance_schema.geometric_tolerance_modifier.offset_zone"
