*)


(*"shape_tolerance_schema.oriented_tolerance_zone_type"
The **oriented_tolerance_zone_type** is a list of modifier types that is used by <<express:shape_tolerance_schema.oriented_tolerance_zone,oriented_tolerance_zone>> to indicate the orientation of an "orientation plane".
*)


(*"shape_tolerance_schema.oriented_tolerance_zone_type.perpendicular"
indicates that the "orientation plane" is oriented perpendicular to the referenced datum.
*)


